<section class="panel">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="eyebrow">Four ways, pick one</div>
		<h1>Install</h1>
		<div class="note"><i></i><div>
			<b>All four routes need the phone unlocked at Xiaomi first.</b>
			A Mi account, seven days of waiting, and it wipes the phone. Start it
			today whichever route you pick &mdash; <a href="unlock.html">step by step
			here</a>.
		</div></div>
		<div class="grid">
			<a href="install-image.html">
				<div class="n">1 &middot; Ready image</div>
				<p><b>Start here.</b> One download, two fastboot commands. Wipes the
				phone.</p></a>
			<a href="install-repo.html">
				<div class="n">2 &middot; Phone already running postmarketOS</div>
				<p>Four commands on the phone. Keeps everything on it.</p></a>
			<a href="install-pmos.html">
				<div class="n">3 &middot; Phone that has never run Linux</div>
				<p>Unlock it at Xiaomi, U-Boot, pmbootstrap, then route 2.</p></a>
			<a href="install-encrypted.html">
				<div class="n">4 &middot; Encrypted</div>
				<p>Build the image yourself, one command. There is no encrypted
				download.</p></a>
		</div>
	</div>
